        <item>
            <title>2.49.0</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 28 Sep 2026 10:57:39 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>143</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.49.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Features
- Search sessions from the sidebar: type in the new search field (or press Cmd+F) to find any past session on this Mac by title or project, including older sessions that no longer appear in the recent list
- Another Mac's section in the sidebar can now be collapsed, and stays collapsed across launches

### Changes
- Tidier sidebar header: New session spans the full width, the filter button sits beside the search field, and the Date / Project / Env switch fills the sidebar width

### Bug Fixes
- In Project grouping, sessions from a git worktree now appear under their repository instead of getting a section of their own per branch
]]></description>
